      "body": "> Can you please share the `git diff` of the mutants? It would facilitate the review.\r\n\r\nDefinitely\r\n\r\n**Boundary change**\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp b/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\nindex 51c5064787..3a11309495 100644\r\n--- a/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\n+++ b/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\n@@ -882,7 +882,7 @@ void OutputGroupTypeMap::Push(const OutputGroup& group, OutputType type, bool in\r\n \r\n CAmount GenerateChangeTarget(const CAmount payment_value, const CAmount change_fee, FastRandomContext& rng)\r\n {\r\n-    if (payment_value <= CHANGE_LOWER / 2) {\r\n+    if (payment_value < CHANGE_LOWER / 2) {\r\n         return change_fee + CHANGE_LOWER;\r\n     } else {\r\n         // random value between 50ksat and min (payment_value * 2, 1milsat)\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Result</summary>\r\n<img width=\"1914\" height=\"396\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/83717f48-2c44-4975-b997-327adefdaaed\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n**Dropped change fee**\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp b/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\nindex 51c5064787..daac915b9f 100644\r\n--- a/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\n+++ b/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\n@@ -887,7 +887,7 @@ CAmount GenerateChangeTarget(const CAmount payment_value, const CAmount change_f\r\n     } else {\r\n         // random value between 50ksat and min (payment_value * 2, 1milsat)\r\n         const auto upper_bound = std::min(payment_value * 2, CHANGE_UPPER);\r\n-        return change_fee + rng.randrange(upper_bound - CHANGE_LOWER) + CHANGE_LOWER;\r\n+        return rng.randrange(upper_bound - CHANGE_LOWER) + CHANGE_LOWER;\r\n     }\r\n }\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Result</summary>\r\n<img width=\"1928\" height=\"596\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed8c6ffb-953c-41a9-bafa-40d2a86429ec\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n**Wrong randrange**\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp b/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\nindex 51c5064787..c19e2d4512 100644\r\n--- a/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\n+++ b/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\n@@ -887,7 +887,7 @@ CAmount GenerateChangeTarget(const CAmount payment_value, const CAmount change_f\r\n     } else {\r\n         // random value between 50ksat and min (payment_value * 2, 1milsat)\r\n         const auto upper_bound = std::min(payment_value * 2, CHANGE_UPPER);\r\n-        return change_fee + rng.randrange(upper_bound - CHANGE_LOWER) + CHANGE_LOWER;\r\n+        return change_fee + rng.randrange(upper_bound) + CHANGE_LOWER;\r\n     }\r\n }\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Result</summary>\r\n<img width=\"1908\" height=\"756\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b749a8ac-85d2-43dd-9716-c78177127352\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n**Skewed distribution**\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp b/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\nindex 51c5064787..9e8ad0e76c 100644\r\n--- a/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\n+++ b/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\n@@ -887,7 +887,8 @@ CAmount GenerateChangeTarget(const CAmount payment_value, const CAmount change_f\r\n     } else {\r\n         // random value between 50ksat and min (payment_value * 2, 1milsat)\r\n         const auto upper_bound = std::min(payment_value * 2, CHANGE_UPPER);\r\n-        return change_fee + rng.randrange(upper_bound - CHANGE_LOWER) + CHANGE_LOWER;\r\n+        const auto range = upper_bound - CHANGE_LOWER;\r\n+        return change_fee + std::min(rng.randrange(range), rng.randrange(range)) + CHANGE_LOWER;\r\n     }\r\n }\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Result</summary>\r\n<img width=\"1928\" height=\"596\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed8c6ffb-953c-41a9-bafa-40d2a86429ec\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n\r\n**Halved upper cap**\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp b/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\nindex 51c5064787..68aaa78f2c 100644\r\n--- a/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\n+++ b/src/wallet/coinselection.cpp\r\n@@ -886,7 +886,7 @@ CAmount GenerateChangeTarget(const CAmount payment_value, const CAmount change_f\r\n         return change_fee + CHANGE_LOWER;\r\n     } else {\r\n         // random value between 50ksat and min (payment_value * 2, 1milsat)\r\n-        const auto upper_bound = std::min(payment_value * 2, CHANGE_UPPER);\r\n+        const auto upper_bound = std::min(payment_value * 2, CHANGE_UPPER / 2);\r\n         return change_fee + rng.randrange(upper_bound - CHANGE_LOWER) + CHANGE_LOWER;\r\n     }\r\n }\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Result</summary>\r\n<img width=\"1932\" height=\"526\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/28e87429-11e3-4e98-bf3a-b4b61514982a\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nI have enumerated all the changes I made to the `GenerateChangeTarget` as requested by @brunoerg",
